econd service startup budget from gameplay clocks and preserves both full input verifications, all resource bounds,64MiB recording, codec, controller and acceptance gates. It has no automatic runtime authority. The original21741 failure remains failed. No formal native field, asset or frontend was changed by this audit; P33 three character bindings at22b816bd remain intact and already verified via the default production API. Full restoration remains active.\n"
